_pdbx_entry_details.entry_id                 8RUC 
_pdbx_entry_details.compound_details         
;RESIDUE 201 OF THE L SUBUNITS IS A MODIFIED ACTIVATOR
LYSINE WHICH IS CARBAMYLATED AT THE EPSILON-AMINO GROUP.
THE MODIFIED LYSINES WITH THEIR CARBAMYL ACTIVATOR GROUP
ARE PRESENTED AS HET GROUPS *KCX* OF L CHAINS  A, C, E, G.
